    <guid isPermaLink="false">69228e9f6018cc2c9824002e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Nov 2025 04:35:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本来以为旅行第一天的突发状况会让整趟旅程变得狼狈，结果反而像是一把奇怪的开关，把后面所有的好运和奇遇全都打开了……</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️本期你将会听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="33">00:33</a>｜旅行第一站就丢钱包！百米冲刺 + 生死时速</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a>｜金阁寺与三岛由纪夫：无法触碰的完美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="896">14:56</a>｜京都绝美日落酒吧 KOHAKU</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="942">15:42</a>｜法语竟可以畅行日本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1047">17:27</a>｜在东京和miumiu的法国 sales大聊特聊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a>｜日本旅行一定要留一顿给便利店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1525">25:25</a>｜日本的两个“世界第一咖啡”到底怎么样！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a>｜只有我们一桌的Omakase体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2024">33:44</a>｜ 夏夜鸭川纳凉寿喜锅的浪漫</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FojnM73hiA26uBMQd_D7uVgL16y_.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmvPBbBuKF_jNUIiOykrPcELjyQ0.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm6R0t98j878_PQG0QG84xlXDJTw.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhU02KZGC1iwfyU4LCFjAAkQmUE8.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft8l5XcElhVamP0SemUbepQ-U1j_.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>💿</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM（picked by Libby）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ocean Side - 菊池桃子</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎁</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作请加vx: reflectionmlmz</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群请加vx: heyheylibby</span></p>]]></description>
