  <item>
    <title>Vol.017 濑户内海艺术祭｜如果你会坐日本的交通，这件事可以写进简历</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ee4722224325ea7039430e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ee4722224325ea7039430e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Oct 2025 12:53:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>跨国主播再聚日本！这次，我们去了一趟濑户内海。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最全面濑户内海攻略 PDF 音频版上线！最全濑户内海交通攻略以及超惊喜高松美食和酒吧🍹</span></p><span></span><p><span>濑户内海是一片散落着艺术与日常的群岛。</span></p><span></span><p><span>艺术家们把作品散落在这些岛屿上，让“前往”本身成为体验的一部分。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人说，濑户内海艺术祭是一场只有 J 人才能完成的旅行——</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为你永远不知道，下一班船在哪个岛、几点开。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们在船与船之间穿梭，看光在纯黑空间中呼吸，</span></p><span></span><p><span>看村民与艺术共生，看石头在阳光下成为语言。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当旅途充满错过、等待与迷路的时候，</span></p><span></span><p><span>或许我们也在学习一种新的“观看方式”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你正准备去濑户内海，</span></p><span></span><p><span>或者只是想听一场关于迷路与风景的故事，</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎上船🌊</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎙️本期你将会听到：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> 从濑户内海艺术祭开始的日本旅行计划！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="161">02:41</a> 什么是濑户内海艺术祭？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 直岛的艺术地图 🗺️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> James Turrell —— 纯黑空间感知光的能量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="632">10:32</a> 当艺术遇上海岛村落：居民、游客与艺术作品的奇妙共处 🐚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 沉浸式观展：在建筑的留白中感受作品的“呼吸”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> 李禹焕和他的石头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">22:17</a> 宫浦港的落日：旅程最浪漫的“谢幕时刻” 🌅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1447">24:07</a> 给要去直岛旅行的朋友们一些做计划的建议（详情见小红书）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1897">31:37</a> 高松美美美食：家庭关东煮、骨付鸟和手打乌冬🍢🍝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2755">45:55</a> 值得为它再去一次高松的bar 🍸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3108">51:48</a> 栗林公园怪谈</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmNFfNdmjf4X89uwlyc_m5vuJlVT.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo4H4oPwdRkWFLuS61NDP4mZeRB0.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmbtc4IoS6naZUcTDkV_NsMbCb5t.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpMA_LDDCFThVfBlaExeIEbCAwvR.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrHK7ZVBLjnpXojbWzhauDnd6tol.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fit3FWJ5bDxOdqa5az_4Y5hUgxZ2.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjIS16HKNF_72rXWUuTSEC3HGhbD.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>💿</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM（picked by Rita）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Suichutoshi - Yogee New Waves</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎁</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作请加vx: reflectionmlmz</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群请加vx: heyheylibby</span></p>]]></description>
