  <item>
    <title>Vol.015 住，是一口锅、一束花、几只冰箱贴和一碗番茄炖菜</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683931d838dcc57c64b8b7ec</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">683931d838dcc57c64b8b7ec</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 30 May 2025 04:22:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“住”是一件慢慢发生的事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从jellycat到炖菜香气，从搬家时舍不得丢的小物件，到一个人独处时突如其来的情绪，我们试着回答一个问题：租来的空间，怎么才算真正“住进去”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们回望那些被锅碗瓢盆、小习惯、情绪和味道占据的时刻。住，不只是拥有一间屋子，更是慢慢安放自己的过程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>沿着物品、味道与情绪的痕迹，回望一个人在外生活的日常与仪式感。关于独居与共居，孤独与陪伴，关于房子如何慢慢变成“家”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️</span><strong><span>本期你将会听到：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> &nbsp;伦敦租房初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="326">05:26</a> &nbsp;Jellycat是独居的开场白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="597">09:57</a> &nbsp;搬家一定会带走什么物品？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="946">15:46</a> &nbsp;一口锅的重量：独居生活的起点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1179">19:39</a> &nbsp;“一人食”菜谱研究：如何又简单又快地做一顿一个人吃的饭？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1699">28:19</a> &nbsp;番茄炖菜人人爱，法国番茄种类大赏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2057">34:17</a> &nbsp;复刻一种生活习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2532">42:12</a> &nbsp;当“梦想小镇”走进现实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2711">45:11</a> &nbsp;独居副作用：难以避免的孤独感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> &nbsp;伦敦适合一个人随便哭的场所list</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3400">56:40</a> &nbsp;我是morning person还是night person？独居节律观察</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3663">1:01:03</a> &nbsp;伦敦搬家经历：从18㎡独居到大house合租的记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpY3IN2SymF1wpoxkgTWjDI5e8EV.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjCYi1-fNIBmgI-KK8o_oWeZBn0m.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FubwFkoz496fzxA6GSpQqzALtpjQ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo_d5l2dIyDkEbYKcf8rPyfEqgzF.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtT4YjZCUSF_RIDfoFxwiXf83Q8R.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>💿</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM（picked by Rita）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Home - Bruno Major</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎁</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作请加vx: reflectionmlmz</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群请加vx: heyheylibby</span></p>]]></description>
