  <item>
    <title>Vol.010 去拥有打开的勇气，也拥有关上之后过自己生活的能力</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6741c6788d1233fb0d6db83a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6741c6788d1233fb0d6db83a</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 23 Nov 2024 12:34:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><p><span>作为《死亡与伤病》系列的上期，我们探讨如何拥有面对死亡的勇气，并在离别后继续好好生活。从亲身经历到文化观察，从《好好告别》的启发到对死亡教育的思考。我们尝试用温柔的方式触碰这些沉重的话题，希望这期声音能为你带来一份关于生命的温柔安慰与思考。</span></p></blockquote><p><strong><span>📔本期封面：</span></strong><span>巴黎蒙帕纳斯公墓（cimetière du montparnasse）</span></p><h2><br></h2><h2><strong><span>🎙️本期你会听到：</span></strong></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a> &nbsp;亲人离世的经历以及对死亡“流程”的思考</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a> &nbsp;麻木、愧疚、无法言说的私人情绪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="910">15:10</a> &nbsp;初次面对后事处理的复杂感受</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">17:42</a>《好好告别》书中的两个启发性问题</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1092">18:12</a> &nbsp;人在死亡时，大多处于什么状态？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1274">21:14</a> &nbsp;如果临终患者想与你讨论死亡，你该怎么做？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a> &nbsp;生命在临终前的反转时刻</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1592">26:32</a> &nbsp;姑息治疗：不只是减少痛苦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1666">27:46</a> &nbsp;我们要如何好好告别？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a> &nbsp;创作作为出口</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1896">31:36</a> &nbsp;亲人去世后，家中娱乐活动是否被允许？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2042">34:02</a> &nbsp;已故亲人为自己做过的一件很感动的事情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2162">36:02</a> &nbsp;生病的知情权属于谁？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2302">38:22</a> &nbsp;死亡教育是现代社会的必需品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2405">40:05</a> &nbsp;死亡的权利：从沙白的瑞士安乐死事件谈起</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2684">44:44</a> &nbsp;艺术治疗：Memory Box</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2780">46:20</a> &nbsp;尼泊尔加德满都的生死河与生死的自然哲学</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3062">51:02</a> &nbsp;“喜丧”的意义：墨西哥亡灵节的文化解读</span></p><p><span>💿</span><strong><span>BGM（picked by Rita）：</span></strong></p><p><span>Watch me (From "This is us") - Grey Reverend</span></p><p><span>🎁</span></p><p><span>商务合作请加vx: reflectionmlmz</span></p><p><span>听友群请加vx: </span><strong><span>heyheylibby</span></strong></p>]]></description>
